<header><p class="st-kicker">tribal confederation · Iberia</p><h1 class="st-title">Lacetani</h1><p class="st-meta">500 BCE – 195 BCE (approx.)</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">An Iberian people of inland Catalonia who resisted Rome during the Second Punic War and Cato's campaign of 195 BCE.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>The Lacetani lived in the interior of <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/empire/principality-of-catalonia">Catalonia</a>, roughly in the modern comarques of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bages">Bages</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anoia">Anoia</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/solsones">Solsonès</a>, from about the 5th century BCE. They were part of the Iberian culture of the north-east and neighbours of the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/ilergetes">Ilergetes</a> and <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/ausetani">Ausetani</a>.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>Their society of fortified hilltop villages lived from farming and herding. Ancient writers, mainly <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/livy">Livy</a>, record them only in wartime, and their name is easily confused with the coastal <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/laietani">Laietani</a>, so many details are uncertain.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>They fought the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/roman-empire">Romans</a> under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gnaeus-cornelius-scipio-calvus">Gnaeus Scipio</a> in 218 BCE and again in the north-eastern revolt of 197 to 195 BCE, when <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cato-the-elder">Cato</a> stormed their chief town. Afterwards they were absorbed into <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/hispania-citerior">Hispania Citerior</a> and their name faded.</p><p class="st-conf">Few sources survive for this state; details are uncertain.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="tribal confederation, 500 BCE – 195 BCE (approx.)"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="44" cy="56" rx="16" ry="24"/><path d="M44 34 V78"/><path d="M68 20 V84"/><path d="M68 20 L63 30 H73 Z"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">tribal confederation</p><p class="st-emblem-region">Iberia</p><div class=